{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">南非發生集體槍擊事件，最少11人死亡、3人受傷，目前正追緝3名疑兇。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.SAF.SHOOTING-0130.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026CPGZXNHJiR1790199331.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.SAF.SHOOTING-0130.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事發於德班市以南一處地點。當地周二深夜三名槍手闖入一個住宅，向屋內聚會的人開槍，10人當場死亡，包括一名孕婦，另有1人送醫後不治。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目前不清楚槍手身份及犯案動機，警方正調查是否涉及幫派衝突，又指部分受害人是警方針對槍械、毒品犯罪活動的調查對象。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.SAF.SHOOTING-0130_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026IbU3IBxrzr1790199328.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.SAF.SHOOTING-0130_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-24T00:59:01.988059+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}